name: Steel Joker — steel-card mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Steel Joker gives X0.2 Mult for each Steel card in the full deck. First-shop scaling
  X-mult: needs a Steel card to appear first; then grow count via The Chariot tarot
  (enhances 1 card to Steel) or DNA (duplicates an existing Steel card).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SteelJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheChariot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
    label: "DNA (duplicates a Steel card to grow count)"
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
